#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-00-99-000001.md:8
msgid "原因"
msgstr "Why this happens"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-00-99-000001.md:10
msgid "回復可能な問題の後に操作を継続したため、結果の一部を確認する必要があります。関連するログの警告で対象の工程を確認できます。"
msgstr ""
"An operation continued after a recoverable problem, so some part of its "
"result needs review. Related Log warnings identify the affected step."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-00-99-000001.md:12
msgid "対処方法"
msgstr "How to resolve it"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-00-99-000001.md:14
msgid ""
"完了した出力を保持し、同じ操作の警告を確認してください。対象の出力を使用前に検査し、報告された問題を修正してから対象の工程を再実行してください。制限が続く場合は関連する警告を添えてBug"
" Feedbackで報告してください。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the completed output and review the warnings from the same "
"operation. Inspect the affected output before using it; retry the "
"affected step after correcting its reported issue. Include those warnings"
" in Bug Feedback if the limitation persists."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-00-99-000001.md:17
msgid "[同じ種類の問題を見る](family-99.md)"
msgstr "[Browse this family](family-99.md)"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-00-99-000001.md:19
msgid "[別のコードを検索](index.md)"
msgstr "[Find another code](index.md)"

